}},{"title":"春晚出游六首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"风急名花纷绛雪，土松香草出瑶簪。\n且呼野艇西村去，未必微云便作阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5528,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚即事四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"龙骨车鸣水入塘，雨来犹可望丰穰。\n老农爱犊行泥缓，幼妇忧蚕采叶忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5529,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚即事四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"渔村樵市过残春，八十三年老病身。\n残虏游魂苗渴雨，杜门忧国复忧民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5530,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚即事四首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"桑麻夹道蔽行人，桃李随风旋作尘。\n煜煜红灯迎妇担，鼕鼕画鼓祭蚕神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5531,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚即事四首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"小时抵死愿春留，老大逢春去即休。\n今岁禹祠才一到，安能分日作遨游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5532,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚怀山南四首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"梨花堆雪柳吹绵，常记梁州古驿前。\n二十四年成昨梦，每逢春晚即凄然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5533,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚怀山南四首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"壮岁从戎不忆家，梁州裘马斗豪华。\n至今夜夜寻春梦，犹在吴园藉落花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5534,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚怀山南四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"身寄江湖两鬓霜，金鞭朱弹梦犹狂。\n遥知南郑城西路，月与梨花共断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5535,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚怀山南四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"梁州一别几清明，常忆西郊信马行。\n桃李成尘总闲事，梨花杨柳最关情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5536,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚村居杂赋绝句六首 其五","author":"陆游","text":"浇书满挹浮蛆瓮，摊饭横眠梦蝶床。\n莫笑山翁见机晚，也胜朝市一生忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5537,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚村居杂赋绝句六首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"朝书牛券拈枯笔，暮祭蚕神酌冻醪。\n闲放无忧穷有意，傍人错羡此翁高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5538,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚村居杂赋绝句六首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"午枕闭门无客搅，夜灯开卷有儿同。\n若为笺与天公道，尽乞馀生向此中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5539,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚村居杂赋绝句六首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"作堤蜿蜿六百尺，西崦东村成一家。\n春雨乍晴桑吐叶，秋风初冷稻吹花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5540,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚村居杂赋绝句六首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"一篙湖水鸭头绿，千树桃花人面红。\n茆舍青帘起余意，聊将醉舞答春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5541,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚感事二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"寒食梁州十万家，鞦韆蹴鞠尚豪华。\n犊车轣辘归城晚，争碾平芜入乱花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5542,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚感事二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"据鞍千里何曾病，闭户安眠百病生。\n每忆嘉陵江上路，插花藉草醉清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5543,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春雪","author":"陆游","text":"江云垂野雪如筛，闰岁春来特地迟。\n倒尽酒壶终日醉，卧听儿诵半山诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5544,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春寒二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"滔天来洚水，震瓦战昆阳。\n此敌犹能禦，春寒不可当。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5545,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春寒二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"高楼坠绿珠，恶客碎珊瑚。\n未抵春寒夜，贫翁丧故襦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5546,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春咏四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"沈家园里花如锦，半是当年识放翁。\n也信美人终作土，不堪幽梦太匆匆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5547,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春咏四首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"熟食从来少天色，东吴况是足春寒。\n城南藉草可痛饮，安得酒肠如海宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5548,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春咏四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"兰亭路上换春衣，梅市桥边送夕晖。\n闻有水仙翁是否，轻舟如叶桨如飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5549,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春咏四首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"方舟冲破湖波绿，联骑蹋残花径红。\n七十年间人换尽，放翁依旧醉春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5550,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]